# {{.Module}}

Generated by `gmx build`. A Go + Gin server with health checks{{if .DB}}, Supabase email/password auth (signup and login){{end}}{{if .Payment}} and a Stripe payment route{{end}}.

```
go build .
go run .
curl localhost:8080{{.Prefix}}/test/ping
{{- if .DB}}
curl localhost:8080{{.Prefix}}/test/db
curl -X POST localhost:8080{{.Prefix}}/auth/signup \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"email": "you@yourdomain.com", "password": "secret123", "username": "yourname"}'
curl -X POST localhost:8080{{.Prefix}}/auth/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"email": "you@yourdomain.com", "password": "secret123"}'
{{- end}}
{{- if .Payment}}
curl -X POST localhost:8080{{.Prefix}}/payments/payment \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"amount": 2000, "currency": "usd", "payment_method": "pm_card_visa"}'
{{- end}}
go test ./...
```

